menu "Board"

config BOARD_DISPLAY_SELFTEST
    bool "Run the RGB scanout colour self-test before LVGL"
    default n
    help
        Fill the ST7701S framebuffer directly with red, green, blue, white and
        eight vertical colour bars before LVGL starts. Intended for bring-up
        diagnostics only; the normal boot continues after the test when
        disabled.

endmenu
